"Building a query by clicking filter buttons instead of typing a sentence.",
"Legacy: session.createCriteria(Student.class).add(Restrictions.gt(\"marks\", 60)).list(). Modern JPA: CriteriaBuilder cb; cq.select(root).where(cb.gt(root.get(\"marks\"), 60)).",
